## Status Definitions

| Status         | Meaning                                                  |
|----------------|----------------------------------------------------------|
| `draft`        | Initial write-up; not yet reviewed.                      |
| `in-review`    | Under active review by stakeholders.                     |
| `accepted`     | Approved and ready for implementation.                   |
| `implemented`  | Fully implemented and verified against acceptance criteria. |

