## Conventions

1. **One module per file** — each spec module lives in `{{ spec_dir }}/modules/NN-slug.md`.
2. **Matching AC files** — every module has a companion `{{ spec_dir }}/acceptance-criteria/NN-slug.md`.
3. **Frontmatter required** — all spec files use YAML frontmatter (see `SCHEMA.md`).
4. **Spec-first changes** — behavioral changes require a spec update *before* code changes.
5. **Decisions are permanent** — ADRs are never deleted; they are `superseded` by newer ones.
6. **Semver for modules** — module `version` follows semantic versioning.
